cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "dormbench: compartment attribution of breast-cancer dormancy signatures"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline for benchmarking transcriptional dormancy signatures
  in ER-positive breast cancer. It scores direction-resolved signatures against
  matched nulls, attributes them to single-cell compartments with donor-level
  paired inference, validates them in independent and spatial data, and tests
  their incremental prognostic value beyond CTS5.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.3.1
date-released: "2026-11-04"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aamiralizai/Dormbench"
url: "https://github.com/Aamiralizai/Dormbench"
# `name` matches the GitHub account and the commit identity. Replace it with the
# full name, add given-names/family-names and an ORCID, and append co-authors
# before the paper is published; GitHub renders this block as "Cite this
# repository". affiliation is inferred from the commit email domain.
authors:
